{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 1137002510328663937,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "RT Scheduler: SCHED_FIFO and SCHED_RR",
      "source_hash": 11594879665430717792,
      "context_hash": 18439567082630885778,
      "translation": "RT 스케줄러: SCHED_FIFO와 SCHED_RR",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495658Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Hard real-time scheduling with priority-based preemption",
      "source_hash": 12382926039900824964,
      "context_hash": 9766333278548596907,
      "translation": "우선순위 기반 선점을 사용하는 경성 실시간 스케줄링",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "preemption": "선점",
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495659Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What the RT scheduler provides",
      "source_hash": 16420794558312418746,
      "context_hash": 7946019469908181296,
      "translation": "RT 스케줄러가 제공하는 것",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495659Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The RT scheduler (`rt_sched_class`) gives tasks strict priority guarantees: an RT task at priority N will always preempt any fair-class task and any RT task at priority < N.",
      "source_hash": 11562021803802298505,
      "context_hash": 2731806198254126902,
      "translation": "RT 스케줄러(`rt_sched_class`)는 태스크에 엄격한 우선순위를 보장합니다. 우선순위 N인 RT 태스크는 항상 모든 fair 클래스 태스크와 우선순위가 < N인 모든 RT 태스크를 선점합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RT task": "RT 태스크",
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495659Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "There is no fairness, no vruntime, no time-sharing between tasks of different priorities — the highest-priority runnable task runs, period.",
      "source_hash": 8115389137256941862,
      "context_hash": 17465841987606003614,
      "translation": "공정성도, vruntime도, 서로 다른 우선순위의 태스크 간 시분할도 없습니다. 실행 가능한 태스크 중 우선순위가 가장 높은 태스크가 실행될 뿐입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "vruntime": "vruntime"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495659Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Two policies share the RT class:",
      "source_hash": 13246007561529354813,
      "context_hash": 11899442153793327723,
      "translation": "RT 클래스는 두 가지 정책이 공유합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "policies": "정책"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495659Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Policy",
      "source_hash": 15600915023236860189,
      "context_hash": 12011061890632382718,
      "translation": "정책",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "policy": "정책"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495660Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Timeslice",
      "source_hash": 9508583837993073297,
      "context_hash": 4412885261908566272,
      "translation": "타임슬라이스",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495660Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Preemption",
      "source_hash": 7389342476243460176,
      "context_hash": 2185822989614680771,
      "translation": "선점",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "preemption": "선점"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495660Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`SCHED_FIFO`",
      "source_hash": 491297706021571958,
      "context_hash": 7435852988483833295,
      "translation": "`SCHED_FIFO`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495660Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "None — runs until it blocks or yields",
      "source_hash": 7941407199150370378,
      "context_hash": 6016141389322850265,
      "translation": "없음 — 블록되거나 양보할 때까지 실행",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495660Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "By higher-priority task only",
      "source_hash": 9457571856069040014,
      "context_hash": 9047811519680771876,
      "translation": "더 높은 우선순위의 태스크에 의해서만",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495660Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "`SCHED_RR`",
      "source_hash": 14513505683258984655,
      "context_hash": 6209765551877497389,
      "translation": "`SCHED_RR`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495660Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "100ms (default)",
      "source_hash": 15794595166526111284,
      "context_hash": 12621626720693746366,
      "translation": "100ms (기본값)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495660Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "By higher-priority task, or same-priority task when slice expires",
      "source_hash": 4645934785470821858,
      "context_hash": 10539451977695470316,
      "translation": "더 높은 우선순위의 태스크, 또는 슬라이스 만료 시 같은 우선순위의 태스크에 의해",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495660Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "RT priorities range from 1 (lowest) to 99 (highest).",
      "source_hash": 5331183114110909300,
      "context_hash": 13801942531496894259,
      "translation": "RT 우선순위의 범위는 1(최저)부터 99(최고)까지입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495660Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:1",
      "source": "This is the reverse of nice values: higher number = higher priority.",
      "source_hash": 6421559645403947120,
      "context_hash": 12290494995040554910,
      "translation": "이는 nice 값과 반대입니다. 숫자가 클수록 우선순위가 높습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495660Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The RT runqueue",
      "source_hash": 2024711090080992809,
      "context_hash": 6765774176870734004,
      "translation": "RT 런큐",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "runqueue": "런큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495661Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`MAX_RT_PRIO = 100` (defined in `include/linux/sched/prio.h`).",
      "source_hash": 4669143869658551206,
      "context_hash": 11557052724784095820,
      "translation": "`MAX_RT_PRIO = 100`(`include/linux/sched/prio.h`에 정의되어 있습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495661Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The bitmap has one bit per priority level — when a task at priority P becomes runnable, bit P is set.",
      "source_hash": 753352008935212955,
      "context_hash": 3044281064528156664,
      "translation": "비트맵은 우선순위 레벨마다 비트 하나를 가지며, 우선순위 P인 태스크가 실행 가능해지면 비트 P가 설정됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bit": "비트",
        "bitmap": "비트맵"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495661Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Task selection is:",
      "source_hash": 11535358112921585329,
      "context_hash": 8660039237411799891,
      "translation": "태스크 선택은 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495661Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "This is O(1) regardless of how many RT tasks exist — the bitmap scan is a single hardware instruction (`bsf`/`bsr` on x86).",
      "source_hash": 4921129863688495933,
      "context_hash": 8876958012758850722,
      "translation": "이는 RT 태스크가 몇 개 있든 O(1)입니다. 비트맵 탐색은 단일 하드웨어 명령어(x86의 `bsf`/`bsr`)로 이루어집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RT tasks": "RT 태스크",
        "bitmap": "비트맵",
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495661Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct sched_rt_entity",
      "source_hash": 13342795174949408248,
      "context_hash": 1407288607769315227,
      "translation": "struct sched_rt_entity",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495661Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Every RT task has a `sched_rt_entity` embedded in its `task_struct`:",
      "source_hash": 14813757763873002902,
      "context_hash": 2729243538031836930,
      "translation": "모든 RT 태스크는 `task_struct`에 `sched_rt_entity`를 내장하고 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RT task": "RT 태스크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495661Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Task selection: pick_next_task_rt()",
      "source_hash": 7017756053757067831,
      "context_hash": 9233205444750663855,
      "translation": "태스크 선택: pick_next_task_rt()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495661Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`pick_next_rt_entity()` finds the first-set bit in the priority bitmap, then returns the head of that queue.",
      "source_hash": 16429239768387953256,
      "context_hash": 17916858252925582099,
      "translation": "`pick_next_rt_entity()`는 우선순위 비트맵에서 처음으로 설정된 비트를 찾은 다음, 해당 큐의 맨 앞 항목을 반환합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bit": "비트",
        "bitmap": "비트맵",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495661Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "For SCHED_RR tasks at equal priority, the queue is FIFO — the task at the front ran least recently (has been waiting longest) and goes to the back after its slice.",
      "source_hash": 18360283903258661256,
      "context_hash": 15291035914626446547,
      "translation": "우선순위가 같은 SCHED_RR 태스크들의 경우 큐는 FIFO입니다. 맨 앞의 태스크는 가장 오래전에 실행된(가장 오래 기다린) 태스크이며, 자신의 슬라이스를 소진한 뒤 맨 뒤로 이동합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FIFO": "FIFO",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495661Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "SCHED_RR timeslice rotation",
      "source_hash": 130280627448176934,
      "context_hash": 11508226485639586514,
      "translation": "SCHED_RR 타임슬라이스 순환",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495661Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "On each timer tick, `task_tick_rt()` runs:",
      "source_hash": 5785096857641037988,
      "context_hash": 10683783421097136146,
      "translation": "타이머 틱마다 `task_tick_rt()`가 실행됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "timer": "타이머"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495662Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The default SCHED_RR timeslice is 100ms:",
      "source_hash": 14842150050861086512,
      "context_hash": 4444481421834050753,
      "translation": "기본 SCHED_RR 타임슬라이스는 100ms입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495662Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "RT throttling",
      "source_hash": 1719554825046728183,
      "context_hash": 12638757206371323038,
      "translation": "RT 스로틀링",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "throttling": "스로틀링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.495662Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "An RT task that never sleeps will starve all normal tasks.",
      "source_hash": 12052282326312659963,
      "context_hash": 13819594592691750745,
      "translation": "잠들지 않는 RT 태스크는 모든 일반 태스크를 기아 상태에 빠뜨립니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RT task": "RT 태스크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:00.409836Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The kernel protects against this with **RT throttling**:",
      "source_hash": 17658258311775511019,
      "context_hash": 13706053186142768330,
      "translation": "커널은 **RT 스로틀링**(RT throttling)으로 이를 방지합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "throttling": "스로틀링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:00.409837Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "RT tasks collectively can use at most `rt_runtime / rt_period` = 95% of CPU time.",
      "source_hash": 5474229432657924151,
      "context_hash": 5000816033225784434,
      "translation": "RT 태스크 전체가 사용할 수 있는 CPU 시간은 최대 `rt_runtime / rt_period` = 95%입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU time": "CPU 시간",
        "RT tasks": "RT 태스크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:00.409838Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The remaining 5% is reserved for SCHED_NORMAL tasks (including the shell, so you can `kill -9` a runaway RT task).",
      "source_hash": 5299351343984250356,
      "context_hash": 4150015159020758163,
      "translation": "나머지 5%는 SCHED_NORMAL 태스크를 위해 예약됩니다(셸도 여기에 포함되므로 폭주하는 RT 태스크를 `kill -9`로 종료할 수 있습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RT task": "RT 태스크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:00.409838Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Setting `sched_rt_runtime_us` to -1 disables throttling entirely.",
      "source_hash": 14889644631766136498,
      "context_hash": 18029291415208140912,
      "translation": "`sched_rt_runtime_us`를 -1로 설정하면 스로틀링이 완전히 비활성화됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "throttling": "스로틀링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:00.409838Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "Only do this if you fully trust your RT tasks.",
      "source_hash": 16423992813819980911,
      "context_hash": 8136257785138374379,
      "translation": "RT 태스크를 완전히 신뢰할 수 있는 경우에만 이렇게 하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RT tasks": "RT 태스크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:00.409839Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Setting RT policy",
      "source_hash": 5932416518039003853,
      "context_hash": 6051705551089733082,
      "translation": "RT 정책 설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "policy": "정책"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:00.409839Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Requires `CAP_SYS_NICE` (or running as root).",
      "source_hash": 7179444999810021465,
      "context_hash": 13652869872942506652,
      "translation": "`CAP_SYS_NICE`(또는 root 권한으로 실행)가 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:00.409839Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Unprivileged users cannot set RT policies.",
      "source_hash": 15718961805303957699,
      "context_hash": 1175314523277260059,
      "translation": "비특권 사용자는 RT 정책을 설정할 수 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "policies": "정책"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:00.409839Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "SMP considerations: pushable tasks",
      "source_hash": 8921550318842214327,
      "context_hash": 561872245143001295,
      "translation": "SMP 고려 사항: pushable 태스크",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:00.409839Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "On multi-CPU systems, the RT scheduler maintains a **pushable tasks** list — RT tasks that could be migrated to another CPU if their current CPU is occupied by a higher-priority RT task.",
      "source_hash": 4316779422820910140,
      "context_hash": 214267795938419464,
      "translation": "다중 CPU 시스템에서 RT 스케줄러는 **pushable 태스크** 목록을 유지합니다. 이 목록에는 현재 CPU를 더 높은 우선순위의 RT 태스크가 점유하고 있을 때 다른 CPU로 마이그레이션될 수 있는 RT 태스크가 담깁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "RT task": "RT 태스크",
        "RT tasks": "RT 태스크",
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:00.409840Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "When a higher-priority RT task arrives on a CPU that's already running an RT task, the lower-priority task is \"pushed\" to another CPU:",
      "source_hash": 201722311685905475,
      "context_hash": 7203426810169832889,
      "translation": "이미 RT 태스크를 실행 중인 CPU에 더 높은 우선순위의 RT 태스크가 도착하면, 낮은 우선순위의 태스크는 다른 CPU로 \"push\"됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "RT task": "RT 태스크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:00.409841Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The `push_rt_task()` and `pull_rt_task()` functions handle this migration.",
      "source_hash": 7470110637544970172,
      "context_hash": 80915278508222853,
      "translation": "`push_rt_task()`와 `pull_rt_task()` 함수가 이 마이그레이션을 처리합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "functions": "함수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:13:00.409841Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
